<title>USA: Milestone unit fires chairman Spinello.</title>
<headline>Milestone unit fires chairman Spinello.</headline>
<dateline>LIVINGSTON, N.J. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Milestone Scientific Inc on Thursday said that its Spintech subsidiary has terminated Ronald Spinello as its chairman and director of research.</p>
<p>Milestone also said it terminated Ronald Spinello and Glen Spinello as directors of that unit.</p>
